  * Load each required payload word once; no 48-byte stack copy/byte reread.
  * The same helper accepts aligned private words in differential tests. */
+/* r68: the compact parser reads words 0..11 (bytes 0..47) only; with a
+ * 64-byte aligned buffer that is exactly one D-cache line. */
+_Static_assert(12 * 4 <= 64 && KDP_BUFFER_BYTES % 64 == 0, "header in one D-cache line");
